------------------------------------
Identify webelement based on visible text and it will ignore white space
like trim() from string 

Syntax:
=======
//tagname[normalize-space()='text']

3.contains(): partial match
-------------------
Syntax:
=======
//tagname[contains(@attribute,'partail value')]

OR

//tagname[contains(text(),'partial text')]
//tagname[contains(normalize-space(),'partial text')]


