Shadow DOM
========================================
Whenever DOM is loaded inside another DOM is called Shadow dom
How to automate any shadow element
----------------------------------
main document--->shadowHost--->shadow root-->shadowElement

which element is shadow element
-----------------------------------
if element is designed with #shadow-root(open) then that element is called shadowelement

Parent element for shadow element is shadow root
Parent element for shadow root is called shadow host

#shadow-root(close): such element you cant automate

Shadow Dom elements you can automate only with cssSelector


